        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 800SE, Oval Single Cylinder Shelburne Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple Shelburne Handleset features oval mounts. This single cylinder Kwikset made 800SE Door Entry Set is operated by key outside, turn knob inside. Solid brass construction backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty from Kwikset. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. A two piece handleset, the Shelburne has a simple elegance that will go well with traditional style homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n <a href=\"/products/shelburne-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802se\"><b>Shelburne Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Traditional Shelburne Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Two Piece 800SE Shelburne Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 12-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Shelburne Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 800SE",
                "description": "Kwikset 800SE Shelburne Single Cylinder Handleset - This simple Shelburne Handleset features oval mounts. This single cylinder Kwikset made 800SE Door Entry Set is operated by key outside, turn knob inside. Solid brass construction backed by a lifetime mechanical and  finish warranty. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. A two piece handleset, the Shelburne has a simple elegance that will go well with traditional style homes.",
